{"name":"Dirty Blonde","hex":"#dfc393","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"dirty blonde","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of a dark blonde color bordering on light brown."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A dark shade of blonde, bordering on light brown.","A person with dark blonde hair."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/dirty_blonde"}],"entries":[{"title":"Blond","blocks":[{"text":"Blond or blonde, also referred to as fair hair, is a human hair color characterized by low levels of eumelanin, the dark pigment. The resultant visible hue depends on various factors, but always has some yellowish color. The color can be from the very pale blond to reddish \"strawberry\" blond or golden-brownish (\"sandy\") blond colors. Occasionally, the state of being blond, and specifically the occurrence of blond traits in a predominantly dark or colored population are referred to as blondism."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8f/Lars-Unnerstall2.jpg/330px-Lars-Unnerstall2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blond"},{"title":"Dirty Blonde (album)","blocks":[{"text":"Dirty Blonde is the fourth studio album by American singer and songwriter Bebe Rexha. It was released on June 12, 2026, through Empire Distribution. Marketed as a visual album, the album incorporates genres including pop, EDM, hip-hop, and country."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/8/85/Bebe_Rexha_-_Dirty_Blonde.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dirty_Blonde_(album)"},{"title":"Dirt","blocks":[{"text":"Dirt  is any matter considered unclean, especially when in contact with a person's clothes, skin, or possessions. In such cases, they are said to become dirty.\nCommon types of dirt include:"},{"items":["Debris: scattered pieces of waste or remains","Dust: a general powder of organic or mineral matter","Filth: foul matter such as excrement","Grime: a black, ingrained dust such as soot","Soil: the mix of clay, sand, and humus which lies on top of bedrock. The term 'soil' may be used to refer to unwanted substances or dirt that are deposited onto surfaces such as clothing."]}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/de/King%27s_Cross%2C_London%3B_the_Great_Dust-Heap%2C_next_to_Battle_Br_Wellcome_V0013642.jpg/330px-King%27s_Cross%2C_London%3B_the_Great_Dust-Heap%2C_next_to_Battle_Br_Wellcome_V0013642.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dirt"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ea/Anonymous_Ferdinand_of_Austria_in_Hungarian_costume_%28detail%29.jpg/500px-Anonymous_Ferdinand_of_Austria_in_Hungarian_costume_%28detail%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ea/Anonymous_Ferdinand_of_Austria_in_Hungarian_costume_%28detail%29.jpg/1280px-Anonymous_Ferdinand_of_Austria_in_Hungarian_costume_%28detail%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ea/Anonymous_Ferdinand_of_Austria_in_Hungarian_costume_%28detail%29.jpg/500px-Anonymous_Ferdinand_of_Austria_in_Hungarian_costume_%28detail%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Detail of a portrait of Sigismund Casimir Vasa (c. 1644), with characteristic blond hair which darkened with time as confirmed by his later effigies","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAnonymous_Ferdinand_of_Austria_in_Hungarian_costume_(detail).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8f/Klara_Gadd.jpg/500px-Klara_Gadd.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.w